# Note of fraud project
## Data Processing
### Q: Unbalanced numbers
- Oversampling the Minority Class
    1. Duplicate existing samples (simple but may lead to overfitting).
    2. Use techniques like SMOTE (Synthetic Minority Oversampling Technique) to generate synthetic samples based on feature space similarities.
- Undersampling the Majority Class: Reduce the number of samples in the overrepresented class.
    1. Randomly remove samples from the majority class (simple but may discard useful data).
    2. Use informed methods like Tomek Links or Cluster Centroids to remove redundant majority samples.
- Class weighting
    1. Adjust the class weights in  ML algorithm to penalize misclassifications of the minority class more heavily. 
    2. Many algorithms (Logistic Regression, Random Forest, SVM, or neural networks) allow  to set class weights. 
